"days" : { "extractionState" : "manual" },
"Deleted items stay in Recently Deleted this long, then the server removes them for good, with their history. 0 keeps them with no limit. Empty uses the server’s default, 60 days, unless whoever runs the server has set another." : { "extractionState" : "manual" },
"versions" : { "extractionState" : "manual" },
"The server keeps every version of an item for the first period, then one a day, then one a week, and removes older ones. Each period must be at least as long as the one before. A type can set its own policy, which wins. Empty uses the server’s defaults, 30, 90 and 365 days and 500 versions, unless whoever runs the server has set others." : { "extractionState" : "manual" },
